":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99372","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99372","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99372.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99372.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-18T15:29:57Z"},"body":"Might fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95649.\r\n\r\nWhile trying to use the editor I got really frustrated with inconsistent clipboard behavior when using wayland.  Often, when text has been selected and then copied, the paste afterwards results in nothing.  Trying to copy again usually succeeds.\r\n\r\nThe best way I have found to reproduce is to copy/paste once, scroll with mouse wheel, try copy/paste again.\r\n\r\nWhen the source selection was reused, wayland seems to send a cancel event for the old(see `_wl_data_source_on_cancelled`), which causes us to destroy the source (which obviously means we didn't send anything to the clipboard now).  Since the selection is now cleared, the second attempt works.\r\n\r\nSetting the selection only when there is not already a source seems to work.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99372/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99372/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}